      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "5. Heard counsel for the applicant and Sri Anupam Ananad, learned brief holder for the State and perused the record.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1179,
      "end": 1295,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Anupam Ananad",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1222,
          "end": 1235
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "6. There is no averment in the affidavits filed by the counsel for the applicant that the applicant was available for interrogation and had co-operated in the investigation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 1297,
      "end": 1470,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3759365677833557
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "Further, issuance of process under Section 82 Cr.P.C. and section 83 Cr.P.C. have not been disputed by the counsel for the applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 1471,
      "end": 1604,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 82",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1506,
          "end": 1516
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1517,
          "end": 1524
        },
        {
          "text": "section 83",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1529,
          "end": 1539
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1540,
          "end": 1547
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3015035390853882
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "7. The Apex Court has held in paragraph 17 in the case of State of Haryana vs. Dharamraj, 2023 SCC Online SC 1085 that an absconder cannot be granted anticipatory bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PRE_RELIED",
      "start": 1606,
      "end": 1774,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Apex Court",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 1613,
          "end": 1623
        },
        {
          "text": "State of Haryana vs. Dharamraj, 2023 SCC Online SC 1085",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1664,
          "end": 1719
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.36119309067726135
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "8. In view thereof, such conduct of the applicant does not entitle him for grant of anticipatory bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1776,
      "end": 1878,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
